  "title": "Easy 100% Whole Wheat Bread",
  "description": "This 100% whole wheat bread is foolproof for beginners. It makes a hearty, flavorful loaf with easy ingredients—perfect for sandwiches or toast.",
  "authors": [
    "Mme Rocha"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-04T00:17:08-04:00",
